      "instructions": "Choose manual-only or a reviewed event or schedule with deduplication and cost rules. Manual-only completes this decision. Reconcile the same asset, campaign, event, and lead IDs; update only changed states, preserve approvals and receipts, and never issue duplicate distribution or lead follow-up."
